---
// src/components/sections/ReadingSection.astro
---

<section class="reading">
    <div class="reading__header">
        <p>Interpretación / Datos</p>

        <p>Ejemplo de interfaz</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reading__content">
        <div class="reading__value">
            <p class="reading__number">42%</p>
            <p class="reading__status">Seco / Demo</p>
        </div>

        <div class="reading__description">
            <h2>Un número solo no alcanza.</h2>

            <p>
                La lectura del sensor necesita contexto. Primero medimos valores
                reales, después calibramos qué significa seco y húmedo para
                nuestra tierra.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .reading {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;

        min-height: calc(100svh - (var(--page-gutter) * 2));
        margin: var(--page-gutter);
        padding: 1.25rem;

        overflow: clip;
        border-radius: var(--section-radius);

        background: var(--color-violet-bg);
        color: var(--color-violet);
    }

    .reading__header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .reading__header p {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .reading__content {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(18rem, 1fr);
        align-items: end;
        gap: 3rem;
    }

    .reading__number {
        margin: 0;

        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(8rem, 22vw, 22rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 0.7;
        letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    }

    .reading__status {
        margin: 2rem 0 0;

        font-size: 0.75rem;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .reading__description {
        padding-top: 1.25rem;

        border-top: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }

    .reading__description h2 {
        max-width: 9ch;
        margin: 0;

        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 0.9;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .reading__description p {
        max-width: 32rem;
        margin: 2rem 0 0;

        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
        .reading {
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .reading__header {
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .reading__content {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            align-content: end;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .reading__number {
            font-size: clamp(8rem, 40vw, 13rem);
        }

        .reading__description h2 {
            max-width: 8ch;
            font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 14vw, 5.5rem);
        }

        .reading__description p {
            max-width: 28rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 24rem) {
        .reading__number {
            font-size: 34vw;
        }
    }
</style>
